# What `wikidata fix` does to the corpus

Generated by `scripts/make-reports.sh`.  For each fragment the repair engine
is offered one action per issue and performs only the ones it can check:
the candidate must answer every question about the declared items exactly as
the base did and must carry no new error.  Everything destructive is left as a
`review` action for a human.  Nothing here is written back to `data/`.

